message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "afa-pipeline-core: core modules of the Android Forensic Analysis Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Read-only evidence ingestion with SHA-256 hashing, an EXIF metadata analyzer with
  anomaly detection, a pluggable analyzer interface and a hash-chained audit log for
  forensic analysis of images recovered from Android devices.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: dorirri
version: 0.1.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dorirri/afa-pipeline-core"
keywords:
  - digital forensics
  - android
  - exif
  - provenance
  - audit log
